# Unit15
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit15核心词汇

resort/rɪˈzɔːrt/求助；度假胜地/We spent the weekend at a beach resort.
resource/ˈriːsɔːrs/资源/Natural resources should be protected.
respond/rɪˈspɑːnd/回应/She responded quickly to the email.
response/rɪˈspɑːns/回应/His response to the question was very clear.
responsible/rɪˈspɑːnsəbl/负责的/She is responsible for the marketing department.
restore/rɪˈstɔːr/恢复/They restored the old building to its original condition.
restrict/rɪˈstrɪkt/限制/The new law restricts the use of plastic bags.
retain/rɪˈteɪn/保持/The company retained its top employees.
reveal/rɪˈviːl/揭示/The investigation revealed the truth.
revenue/ˈrevənuː/收入/The company's revenue increased by 20% this year.
reverse/rɪˈvɜːrs/反转/He reversed the car into the parking space.
revolution/ˌrevəˈluːʃn/革命/The industrial revolution changed the world.
reward/rɪˈwɔːrd/奖励/She received a reward for her excellent work.
rhythm/ˈrɪðəm/节奏/She moved her body to the rhythm of the music.
rigid/ˈrɪdʒɪd/严格的；僵硬的/The rules are too rigid to allow exceptions.
role/roʊl/角色/She plays an important role in the company.
rough/rʌf/粗糙的；大约的/The road is very rough after the rain.
routine/ruːtiːn/日常/She follows a strict daily routine.
rural/ˈrʊrəl/农村的/He grew up in a rural area.
sacrifice/ˈsækrɪfaɪs/牺牲/She sacrificed her career for her family.
sample/ˈsæmpl/样本/The doctor took a blood sample for testing.
satellite/ˈsætəlaɪt/卫星/The satellite orbits the earth every 90 minutes.
satisfy/ˈsætɪsfaɪ/满足/The results satisfied everyone.
scale/skeɪl/规模；天平/The project is on a large scale.
scarce/skers/缺乏的/Fresh water is scarce in this region.
schedule/ˈskedʒuːl/日程/What is your schedule for tomorrow?
scheme/skiːm/计划/He devised a scheme to save money.
scope/skoʊp/范围/The scope of the project is very broad.
secure/sɪˈkjʊr/安全的/Make sure the door is secure.
seek/siːk/寻求/She sought advice from her mentor.
segment/ˈseɡmənt/部分/This segment of the market is growing rapidly.
select/sɪˈlekt/选择/She selected the best candidate for the job.
senior/ˈsiːniər/高级的/He is a senior manager in the company.
sense/sens/感觉；意义/She has a good sense of humor.
sensitive/ˈsensətɪv/敏感的/She is very sensitive to criticism.
sequence/ˈsiːkwəns/顺序/Please arrange the events in the correct sequence.
session/ˈseʃn/会议；一段时间/The training session lasts two hours.
settle/ˈsetl/解决；定居/They settled the dispute out of court.
severe/sɪˈvɪr/严重的/He suffered severe injuries in the accident.
shallow/ˈʃæloʊ/浅的/The river is too shallow for swimming.
shelter/ˈʃeltər/避难所/The camp provides shelter for refugees.
shift/ʃɪft/转变/There has been a shift in public opinion.
shortage/ˈʃɔːrtɪdʒ/短缺/There is a shortage of skilled workers.
shrink/ʃrɪŋk/缩小/The economy shrank by 2% last year.
signal/ˈsɪɡnəl/信号/The traffic signal turned red.
significance/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns/重要性/The discovery has great significance.
significant/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt/重大的/There has been a significant improvement.
similar/ˈsɪmɪlər/类似的/The two plans are very similar.
simplify/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/简化/We need to simplify the process.
simultaneously/ˌsaɪməlˈteɪniəsli/同时地/Both events happened simultaneously.
